{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>With a stone</b> — three times in the Masorah: here and the other two: והכה איש את רעהו באבן, באבן המלך. And if he struck a man with a stone — if it is a hand-stone, assessment is required, that it be of a size to kill, as stated: אשר ימות בה. But if it is as large as the king's stone, no assessment is required — it is self-evidently of a size to kill."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:46.670806Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}